/// prefix icon. The following snippet shows how to pad the trailing edge of
/// the suffix icon:
///
/// ```dart
/// suffixIcon: Padding(
///   padding: const EdgeInsetsDirectional.only(end: 12.0),
///   child: _myIcon, // myIcon is a 48px-wide widget.
/// )
